.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-release-guard 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-release\-guard \- Exit 0 only when a build of the commit may upload into the release: a draft that targets it
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten release guard\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-sha\fR> <\fItag\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Exit 0 only when a build of the commit may upload into the release: a draft that targets it
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-sha\fR \fI<sha>\fR
The commit the build was dispatched with
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fItag\fR>
The release\*(Aqs tag
